/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (A "drone" is just a quadcopter. An FPV \(First-Person View\) drone is a special type where the pilot flies by looking through a camera on the front of the drone, similar to VR Goggles.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
